MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Critical bug fix: the clients roster was reading revenue/orders from a dead
DB table (getShopDaily) even in live mode, so every client silently showed
$0/0 in production — now branches to the same live Shopify pull every other
report page already uses.

Also completes the top of the post-audit punch list:
- Client login rate limiting: 5 failed attempts locks the account for 15
  minutes (per-account), with an admin "Unlock" override in Settings.
- Suspend/reactivate a client — blocks their portal login only, admin
  access and data untouched, reversible with one click.
- Edit client (rename, set a website) and Delete client (soft-delete via
  archivedAt, never a hard cascade-delete) with a restore affordance.
- Search + status filter on the clients list.
- Suspended/archived workspaces are now also excluded from the admin
  workspace switcher and from client-portal session validation, so both
  "suspend" and "delete" actually cut off access everywhere, not just on
  the roster page.

New migration: supabase/migrations/0005_workspace_status_and_login_lockout.sql
(run in the Supabase SQL editor — adds workspaces.status and two client_users
lockout columns, idempotent/safe to run once).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RByRngyvngbCJ9TiNsChTz
